    <summary>AppGallery Connect CLI command center</summary>
    <description>agc CLI is a Go command-line tool for AppGallery Connect automation. It helps developers bind project profiles, inspect API calls with dry-run output, invoke supported AppGallery Connect endpoints, export reports, manage uploads, and run a local REST command center for CI or agent workflows.</description>
